## 🐛 **Common Issues & Fixes**

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `ModuleNotFoundError: streamlit.proto` | `pip install protobuf==4.*` |
| `torch` install fails on Windows | Enable long paths: `git config --system core.longpaths true` |
| `stage2.pipeline` import error | `pip install -e .` from repo root |
| Git push rejected | `git pull origin main --rebase && git push` |
| Tests fail on `test_app.py` | Skip: `pytest --ignore=tests/stage2/test_app.py` |

